# Build context hygiene. Two of these are load-bearing rather than cosmetic:
#
#  - node_modules: the console stage runs `bun install` and then `COPY web/ ./`.
#    Without this line that COPY would overwrite the container's freshly installed
#    tree with the HOST's — built for a different libc, and on a different arch on
#    an arm64 laptop — and the build would fail or, worse, produce a broken bundle.
#  - .env / secrets: never in a layer, even a discarded one.
node_modules
web/node_modules

# Rebuilt inside the image; a stale host copy would silently win.
web/dist
web/.output
web/.nitro
web/.tanstack
web/.wrangler
dist

.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
receipts
data

.git
.github
.claude-plugin
*.md
!docs/RECEIPTS.md
